Project Name: Web-LLM Bot
About Project : An advanced, context-aware AI chatbot and knowledge engine designed to deliver accurate, real-time answers by combining local knowledge with dynamic web intelligence. Built using the MERN stack, TypeScript, and LangChain, the application optimizes response relevance by integrating a real-time web search loop powered by the Tavily AI API. When a user query requires external validation or up-to-date facts, the system automatically routes the request to execute targeted web searches, intelligently filtering and compressing verbose live data into clean, dense context snapshots. By injecting this real-time summarized context directly into the LLM context window, the engine successfully minimizes hallucinations and delivers highly precise, source-backed responses, all wrapped in a modern UI built with Tailwind CSS.
